 "buyers_guide": [
  {
   "q": "What size power station do I need?",
   "a": "Add up what you want to run. A fridge needs roughly 1 to 2 kWh a day, a CPAP about 0.5 kWh a night, and a router and phone chargers well under that. Output in watts limits what can run at once; capacity in watt-hours limits how long."
  },
  {
   "q": "What does the app add?",
   "a": "Live input and output, remaining runtime, charge limits, and scheduled charging during cheap off-peak hours. Some models also report to Home Assistant."
  },
  {
   "q": "Can it back up my whole house?",
   "a": "Only larger systems with a transfer switch or smart panel, sold separately. Most portable units power devices plugged into them, and some offer a UPS-style switchover in a few milliseconds."
  }
 ],
